        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DCH218, Hidden Door Hinges for 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConcealed Hinges are hidden from view when the door is closed. The 4-5/8 Inch x 1-1/8 Inch Invisible Hinge is most often used doors where a clean look is desired. When the door is closed, Deltana's DCH218 Invisible Hinge cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. Package includes a pair of hinges (2 hinges).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"261\"border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DCH218-specifications.gif?v=1704354602\" width=\"261\" height=\"285\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DCH218 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on <b>1-3/4\" Thick Doors</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/hidden-door-hinge-pair-deltana-dch216\"><b>1-3/8\" Thick Door Hidden Hinge</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/invisible-door-hinge-for-1-3-4-inch-thick-doors-soss-218\"><b>Steel 4-5/8\" x 1-1/8\" Invisible Door Hinge</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 1-3/4 Thick Door Hidden Door Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height center to center: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knuckle Height: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Pressure cast zinc housing and 304 Stainless Steel links</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DCH218-specifications.pdf?v=1691095353\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DCH218 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
