                "title": "Hidden Door Hinge for 1-3/4 Thick Door, Pair, Deltana DCH218",
                "description": "Deltana DCH218  4-5/8 Inch x 1-1/8 Inch Invisible Hinge - Concealed Hinges are hidden from view when the door is closed. Deltana's DCH218 features no visible knuckle when the door is closed. The 4-5/8 Inch x 1-1/8 Inch Invisible Hinge is most often used doors where a clean look is desired. When the door is closed, DCH218 Invisible Hinge cannot be seen or tampered with. When opened, the riveted hinge pin is non-removable. The installed hinge is firmly anchored in a deep, full mortise, which assists the screws in supporting the door, assuring a stronger door hinge installation. Package includes a pair of hinges (2 hinges).",
